  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw3000.html",
  "prefLabel": "Sw 3001.12 Renewal Subscriptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 3001.12 Renewal Subscriptions.\n\n(a) Subscription renewal forms shall be forwarded to the subscriber by the commission prior to the subscription's expiration date.\n\n(b) The subscription renewal form shall contain the following information:\n\n(1) Subscriber's name;\n\n(2) Subscriber's address;\n\n(3) Five 2-digit numbers and one additional 2-digit number;\n\n(4) Subscriber number;\n\n(5) Subscription number; and\n\n(6) Expiration date including free play extensions.\n\n(c) If the subscriber elects to continue a subscription, the subscriber shall provide the commission with the following information:\n\n(1) Subscription play length;\n\n(2) Change of address, if applicable;\n\n(3) Payment method; and\n\n(4) A change of numbers of five 2-digit numbers and one additional 2-digit number, if applicable.\n\n(d) If the subscriber selects payment for the subscription by credit card, the following shall be provided to the commission:\n\n(1) Credit card number;\n\n(2) Credit card expiration date;\n\n(3) Cardholder's name;\n\n(4) Cardholder's address;\n\n(5) Cardholder's home telephone number;\n\n(6) Cardholder's work telephone number, if applicable; and\n\n(7) Cardholder's signature, if the credit card information is submitted on a subscription form.\n\n(e) If the subscriber selects payment for subscription by check, the check shall be payable to the New Hampshire Lottery Commission and attached to the subscription renewal form.\n\n(f) The completed subscription renewal form shall be forwarded to the commission headquarters for processing.\n\n(g) Upon receipt of the subscription renewal form, the commission shall enter the subscriber's information into a lottery approved subscription database program.\n\n(h) The database program shall assign the next available effective draw date for the subscription, as determined by MUSL.\n\n(i) The database program shall assign a subscription number to the subscription.\n\n(j) The commission shall assign the following identification numbers to the subscription:\n\n(1) Batch number; and\n\n(2) Sequence or certificate number.\n\n(k) The commission shall print a subscription confirmation card listing the following information:\n\n(1) Subscriber name;\n\n(2) Subscriber address;\n\n(3) Five 2-digit numbers and one additional 2-digit number;\n\n(4) Day, month and year the subscription is effective;\n\n(5) Day, month and year the subscription expires;\n\n(6) A gift message, if applicable;\n\n(7) Subscription number;\n\n(8) Batch number; and\n\n(9) Sequence or certificate number.\n\n(l) The commission shall forward a subscription confirmation card to the subscriber.\n\nSource. #8543, eff 1-21-06; ss by #9519, eff 7-25-09, EXPIRED: 7-25-17\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw3000.html"
}
